    <text:p text:style-name="P31"><text:span text:style-name="T20">Solving (</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20"><text:sequence-ref text:reference-format="value" text:ref-name="refEquation0">1</text:sequence-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20">) for the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T19">electrical </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20">current and setting the temperature to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21">its</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20"> maximal allowed limit yields the maximally allowed current</text:span></text:p>
