    <text:p text:style-name="P37"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Fig. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:sequence-ref text:reference-format="value" text:ref-name="refFigure0">1</text:sequence-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"><text:s/>shows the maximally allowed power transmission for different environmental conditions. <text:s/></text:span></text:p>
